[{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>For each of the following functions, sketch the graph and state whether it is one-to-one or if it is many-to-one.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p><strong>The answers for the following questions which require a range of values should be given in set notation.</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is one-to-one</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is many-to-one</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is one-to-one</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>State the largest possible domain and range of the following functions:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y\\geq1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Domain: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{x:x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ -1&lt;y&lt;1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>State the range of the following, given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&lt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y&lt;0\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y\\geq1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ -1&lt;y&lt;0\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>State the range of the following, given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sinh^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)=\\tanh(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"h(x)=-\\cosh^2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\tanh^2x+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ f(x)\\geq0\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y\\geq4\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{g(x):g(x)\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ -1&lt;g(x)&lt;1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R}\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{h(x):h(x)\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ h(x)\\leq-1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\text{Range: }\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ 5\\leq y&lt;6\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q5","number":5,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\sinh x+4\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ae^x+be^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are real constants.</p></li><li><p>Hence explain why, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\sinh x+4\\cosh x&gt;e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2\\sinh x+4\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv 2\\times\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2+4\\times\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv e^x-e^{-x}+2e^x+2e^{-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv 3e^x+e^{-x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3e^x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3e^x+e^{-x}&gt;e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore 2\\sinh x+4\\cosh x&gt;e^{-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Show clearly that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4\\sinh^2x-e^{-2x}&gt;-2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q7: Hyperbolic Double-Angle Formulae</strong></p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4\\sinh^2x-e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv4\\left(\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2\\right)^2-e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv(e^x-e^{-x})^2-e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv e^{2x}-2+e^{-2x}-e^{-2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv e^{2x}-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{2x}&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{2x}-2&gt;-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore4\\sinh^2x-e^{-2x}&gt;-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q7","number":7,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh 2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, write down the range of:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\" type=\"i\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh 2x&gt;\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol><p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q8--Q10: Differentiation of Hyperbolic Functions</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh2x\\equiv2\\sinh x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b i)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y&gt;0\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b ii)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\{y:y\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ y&gt;1\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh2x=2\\sinh x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>From b) i) we know that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and from b) ii) we know that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x&gt;1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\cosh x&gt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Multiply both sides by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (which maintains the inequality as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>):</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2\\sinh x\\cosh x&gt;2\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Also we know that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\sinh x&gt;\\sinh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\sinh2x=2\\sinh x\\cosh x&gt;2\\sinh x&gt;\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\sinh2x&gt;\\sinh x\\text{ for }x&gt;0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>The graph below shows <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sinh x+2\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.15/questions/assets/diagrams/FMQ_2.15_question8_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Find the exact largest possible range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, writing your answer in set notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sinh x+2\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=\\cosh x+2\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Stationary points exist when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\cosh x+2\\sinh x=0\\Rightarrow1+2\\tanh x=0\\Rightarrow\\tanh x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+(-\\frac12)}{1-(-\\frac12)}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{\\frac12}{\\frac32}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right)=\\sinh\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right)+2\\cosh\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac13\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{e^{\\frac12\\ln\\frac13}-e^{-\\frac12\\ln\\frac13}}2+2\\times\\frac{e^{\\frac12\\ln\\frac13}+e^{-\\frac12\\ln\\frac13}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{e^{\\ln(\\frac1{\\sqrt3})}-e^{\\ln(\\sqrt3)}}2+e^{\\ln(\\frac1{\\sqrt3})}+e^{\\ln(\\sqrt3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac32e^{\\ln(\\frac1{\\sqrt3})}+\\frac12e^{\\ln(\\sqrt3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt3}+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Range is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ f(x)\\geq\\sqrt3\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>The graph below shows the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\\cosh x-\\sinh x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on the curve are stationary points and have <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.15/questions/assets/diagrams/FMQ_2.15_question9_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>It is given that the function <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is defined as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=3\\cosh x-\\sinh x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in[a,b]\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in interval notation.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=3\\cosh x-\\sinh x\\cosh x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=3\\sinh x-\\sinh^2x-\\cosh^2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Stationary points exist when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3\\sinh x-\\sinh^2x-\\cosh^2x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3\\sinh x-\\sinh^2x-(\\sinh^2x+1)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=2\\sinh^2x-3\\sinh x+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0=(2\\sinh x-1)(\\sinh x-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=\\frac12\\text{ or }\\sinh x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=\\frac12\\Rightarrow x=\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2+1}\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=1\\Rightarrow x=\\ln\\left(1+\\sqrt{1^2+1}\\right)=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\\right)=3\\cosh\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\\right)-\\sinh\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cosh\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}+e^{-\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}}2-\\frac{e^{\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}-e^{-\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}}2\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}+e^{-\\ln(\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2})}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3\\times\\frac{\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}-\\frac12}{2}-\\frac{\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}-(\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}-\\frac12)}2\\times\\frac{\\frac12+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}-\\frac12}{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{2}-\\frac12\\times\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt5}{4}=\\frac{5\\sqrt5}{4}\\approx2.795\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))=3\\cosh(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))-\\sinh(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))\\cosh(\\ln(1+\\sqrt2))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}+e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}2-\\frac{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}-e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}2\\times\\frac{e^{\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}+e^{-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)}}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3\\times\\frac{1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2-1}{2}-\\frac{1+\\sqrt2-(\\sqrt2-1)}2\\times\\frac{1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2-1}{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=3\\sqrt2-\\sqrt2=2\\sqrt2\\approx2.828\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Range is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\\in\\left(\\frac{5\\sqrt5}{4},2\\sqrt2\\right]\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.15-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>It is given that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\tanh^2x,\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb{R}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=2(e^x+e^{-x})^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\in\\mathbb{R}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the coordinates of the stationary point of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>State the range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in set notation.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\tanh^2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\frac{\\sinh^2x}{\\cosh^2x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\frac{(\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2)^2}{(\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2)^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\frac{(e^x-e^{-x})^2}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}-\\frac{e^{2x}-2+e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{e^{2x}+e^{-2x}-e^{2x}+2-e^{-2x}}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv\\frac{2}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv2(e^x+e^{-x})^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Stationary points exist when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=-4(e^x-e^{-x})(e^x+e^{-x})^{-3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\equiv-\\frac{4(e^x-e^{-x})}{(e^x+e^{-x})^3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f'(x)=0\\Rightarrow-\\frac{4(e^x-e^{-x})}{(e^x+e^{-x})^3}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^x-e^{-x}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^{2x}-1=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow e^{2x}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow x=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(0)=2(e^0+e^0)^{-2}=\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the stationary point has coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(0,\\frac12\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to+\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\\to0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\\to-\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{2}{(e^x+e^{-x})^2}\\to0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\{f(x):f(x)\\in\\mathbb{R},\\ 0&lt;f(x)\\leq\\frac12\\}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]}]